# The rendered page and its lookup bank, 33 MB between them. They are
# build outputs: publish-site.sh force-adds them from the working tree
# to the `site` branch, which is the branch Render serves (22 Oct).
# Ignoring them here is what stops a `git add -A web/...` in a workflow
# putting them back on main and growing it 33 MB a push.
web/index.html
web/matchbank.json
